pdf2zh-rust is an independent Rust application. It is not an official PDFMathTranslate-next release.

Upstream behavior and asset metadata reference:
PDFMathTranslate-next / PDFMathTranslate-next (AGPL-3.0)
https://github.com/PDFMathTranslate-next/PDFMathTranslate-next
funstory-ai / BabelDOC (AGPL-3.0)
https://github.com/funstory-ai/BabelDOC

The runtime uses MuPDF through the mupdf Rust crate (AGPL-3.0), and ONNX Runtime through ort (MIT or Apache-2.0 binding; native ONNX Runtime MIT).
https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/mupdf
https://github.com/messense/mupdf-rs
https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
https://github.com/pykeio/ort

Resource files are not included in this Git repository. Prepared bundles contain the selected DocLayout-YOLO model and Source Han Serif font as separate assets. Their upstream notices and licenses remain applicable:
https://github.com/opendatalab/DocLayout-YOLO
https://github.com/adobe-fonts/source-han-serif
https://github.com/funstory-ai/BabelDOC-Assets

Cargo.lock records Rust dependency versions. Local verification artifacts, PDFs, credentials and native binaries are excluded from version control.
